---
// Equal Housing Opportunity mark + statement, expected on rental advertising.
---
<div class="eho">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="38" height="38" role="img" aria-label="Equal Housing Opportunity">
    <path d="M20 4 L36 16 H32 V35 H8 V16 H4 Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    <rect x="13" y="20" width="14" height="3.2" fill="currentColor" />
    <rect x="13" y="26" width="14" height="3.2" fill="currentColor" />
  </svg>
  <p>
    <strong>Equal Housing Opportunity.</strong> We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color,
    religion, sex, disability, familial status, national origin, or any other class protected by
    federal, state, or local law.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .eho { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .eho svg { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--ink); }
  .eho p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 34rem; }
</style>
